"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"></p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Your creation will need to be in an empty folder, containing just the files you want to be packaged. Please note that the <span style=\" font-weight:600; color:#000000;\">WHOLE </span><span style=\" color:#000000;\">directory, with all its content, will be packaged.</span></p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"></p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">If you are going to use a custom license, please</p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">remember to add a file called '<span style=\" font-weight:600;\">COPYING</span>'  in the top level of the directory you are going to package.</p>"
"</body></html>"
